UPDATE companies SET description='The company rebranded as Finwave in 2022 to mark its transition from stealth development to commercial production.

The technology has been scaled from 1 cm² research wafers to 8-inch production wafers, with manufacturing outsourced to silicon foundry partners. Finwave offers evaluation kits and conducts 100% wafer-level and packaged-device testing, including HTOL reliability stress screening.

Finwave’s devices target aerospace and defense, mobile infrastructure (5G/6G base stations), smartphones, satellite communications, automotive radar, medical equipment, and test & measurement applications. Customers include global distributors and OEMs seeking higher linearity, lower power consumption, and simplified digital pre-distortion.

The company differentiates itself through a patented device-level linearization technique that reduces electron-trapping memory effects and enables novel power combining, delivering higher intrinsic linearity than conventional GaAs or GaN approaches. This allows more efficient power amplifiers at backoff and simpler DPD algorithms, reducing overall system energy use.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["GaN-on-Si RF IC design", "FinFET process development", "RF switch design", "Power amplifier design", "Device modeling and simulation", "Wafer-level electrical testing", "Packaged device testing", "HTOL reliability testing", "Supplier qualification and quality management", "Phased-gate product development", "ISO-compliant quality management system", "Evaluation kit (EVK) development"], "industries": ["Aerospace and Defense", "Mobile Infrastructure", "Smartphones", "Satellite Communications", "Automotive Radar", "Medical Devices", "Test and Measurement", "Cloud Computing"], "materials": ["Gallium Nitride (GaN)", "Silicon (Si)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Waltham, Massachusetts -> db", "Founded as Cambridge Electronics in 2012 by MIT professor Tom\u00e1s Palacios -> /about-us", "Rebranded to Finwave in 2022 -> /about-us", "Fabless semiconductor company designing GaN-on-Si RF switches and power amplifiers -> /about-us, /", "Scaled wafer sizes from 1 cm\u00b2 to 8-inch wafers -> /about-us", "Partnerships with silicon foundries for high-volume manufacturing -> /about-us", "100% wafer-level and packaged-device testing, HTOL testing -> /quality", "Industries served: Aerospace and Defense, mobile infrastructure, smartphones, medical devices, cloud computing, automotive, satellites, test & measurement -> /, /about-us", "Patented device-level linearization for PAs and LNAs -> /, /about-us", "FinFET technology, E-mode GaN-on-Si -> /, /about-us", "ISO-compliant QMS tar