UPDATE companies SET description='Forbes Distributing Company, Inc. operates from Homewood, Alabama, where it has supplied electronic parts and accessories for over 70 years.

The firm carries a broad catalog that includes batteries, computer cables, connectors, fans, home theater and HDMI accessories, LED flashlights, network and LAN equipment, relays, security and surveillance devices, semiconductors, gaming console cables, surge protectors, UPS units, tools, and TV mounts. It stocks branded products such as NEBO flashlights, SignaMax keystone jacks, and Vanco IR adapters, and fulfills orders through an e-commerce platform with a shopping cart system.

