UPDATE companies SET description='Forsey''s Fine Furniture and Interior Design has operated from Salt Lake City, Utah, since 1951, when brothers Jack and Harry Forsey founded the business on a model specializing in American-made Colonial Maple home furnishings. The company remains in its third generation of family ownership, now led by Jack Forsey and his wife Michelle.

The retailer carries over 40 brands of home furnishings, the vast majority manufactured in the United States, Canada, or Europe, and operates two showrooms on Highland Drive — one dedicated exclusively to Stickley Furniture, for which Forsey''s has been the exclusive Utah dealer since the late 1990s, and a second multi-vendor showroom. Beyond retail sales, the company provides interior design services, free in-home consultations, commercial project furnishing, and drop-ship delivery across the continental United States, supported by a white-glove delivery team.

Customers range from residential buyers seeking a single piece to designers and businesses outfitting large commercial spaces. The company''s vendor relationships emphasize domestically and ethically sourced products, and its staff — composed of designers, artists, and other professionals — works without commission to focus on client needs.

Forsey''s differentiates itself through a pressure-free, family-owned culture that eliminated commission pay, a curated selection vetted by its design and delivery teams, and a commitment to quality without compromise that has sustained the business for over seven decades.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Retail home furnishings sales", "Interior design services", "In-home design consultations", "Commercial project furnishing", "Drop-ship delivery", "White-glove delivery", "Product curation and vendor vetting"], "industries": ["Residential furniture retail", "Commercial furniture", "Interior design services"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Exclusive Stickley Furniture dealer for Utah since late 1990s", "Over 40 vetted brands made primarily in USA, Canada, Europe", "No-commission sales model for pressure-free shopping", "Free in-home design consultations", "Drop-ship and white-glove delivery across continental US"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1951 by Jack and Harry Forsey -> /about-us", "Third-generation family ownership, now led by Jack Forsey and wife Michelle -> /about-us", "Two showrooms on Highland Drive in Salt Lake City -> /about-us", "Exclusive Stickley Furniture dealer for Utah since late 1990s -> /about-us", "Carries over 40 brands, majority made in USA, Canada, Europe -> /", "Interior design services, free in-home consultations, commercial projects -> /about-us", "Drop-ship services to continental US -> /about-us", "No-commission pay for staff -> /about-us", "White-glove delivery team -> /", "Family owned and locally operated -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Our retail showrooms speak to this philosophy, as do the vendors we partner with and products we provide.", "founded_year": "1951", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownershi