UPDATE companies SET description='Fresca Foods Inc is headquartered in Louisville, Colorado, with additional manufacturing and warehouse facilities in Aurora. The company operates as a multi-platform co-manufacturer and innovator of shelf-stable snacks and baked goods, specializing in natural and organic foods. Leadership includes Chairman Todd Dutkin and Chief Executive Officer Brandon Viar, supported by a team of executives overseeing operations, growth, finance, and human resources.

The company produces bars, bites, cereals, granolas, cookies, crackers, and hot-fill products across 18-plus production lines. Core manufacturing platforms include cold-form extrusion, extruded baking, and cereal and granola processing, complemented by hot-fill processing and packaging capabilities. Facilities span 350,000 square feet across two manufacturing plants and two logistics and warehouse centers, utilizing RedZone connectivity software for real-time production data.

Fresca Foods serves global and emerging consumer-packaged-goods brands in the natural and organic food sector, offering co-manufacturing, co-packing, and product innovation services. Customers range from established national brands to early-stage companies seeking retail-ready products, with the Fresca Food Lab providing ideation, development, and consumer-testing support.

The company emphasizes customization, agility, and transparency, integrating tailored solutions into daily operations. All plants are powered by 100% renewable energy, and the firm holds a broad suite of certifications including USDA Organic, Non-GMO Project Verified, Fairtrade, and various gluten-free, vegan, and kosher designations. Flexible pricing models such as tolling and purchased finished goods aim to support long-term partnerships.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF','USDA Organic','Non-GMO Project Verified','Fairtrade','GFCO Certified Gluten Free','Certified Vegan','OU Kosher','Grain Free','Paleo','Soy-free','FSMA Compliant','Good Manufacturing Practices Adherent']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cold form extrusion", "Extruded baking", "Cereal and granola processing", "Hot fill processing and packaging", "Custom manufacturing", "Co-manufacturing", "Co-packing", "New product ideation", "Product development", "Innovation accelerator", "Samples production for consumer testing", "Shelf-stable snack production", "Baked goods production", "Retail-ready packaging"], "industries": ["Natural and organic foods", "Consumer packaged goods (CPG)", "Emerging natural food brands", "Food brands with national distribution"], "materials": ["Organic ingredients", "Non-GMO ingredients", "Gluten-free ingredients", "Vegan ingredients", "Fairtrade ingredients"], "equipment": ["Cold form extrusion platform", "Extruded baking platform", "Hot fill processing platform", "RedZone connectivity software"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Customized manufacturing solutions integrated into daily operations", "18+ production lines across 350,000 sq ft of manufacturing and warehouse space", "100% renewable energy powered facilities", "Flexible pricing models including tolling and purchased finished goods", "Comprehensive certifications: USDA Organic, Non-GMO, Fairtrade, Gluten-Free, Vegan, Kosher"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Louisville, CO and Aurora, CO