UPDATE companies SET description='G & E Steel Inc. operates from Salem, Massachusetts, serving the North Shore region of New England. The company was founded in 1976 by Antonio Ciasullo, an Italian‑American master artisan with decades of metalworking experience. After Ciasullo’s passing, his sons Gino and Emilio took over; Gino, a Bentley College graduate, serves as treasurer and chief operating officer, while Emilio, a Worcester Polytechnic Institute engineering graduate, holds the title of president and senior project manager. The business remains family‑owned and operated.

Services cover the full project lifecycle: design assistance, field measurement, fabrication, delivery, and installation. The company also offers a one‑year warranty on fabricated work and provides free quotes. No facility size or employee count is published.

Customers include commercial contractors, private homeowners, and at least one federal agency (the United States Postal Service). The firm’s service area spans Salem, Swampscott, Marblehead, Gloucester, Newburyport, and surrounding Essex County communities.

G & E Steel positions itself as a one‑stop shop, handling every step from initial design through final installation. The founders’ emphasis on craftsmanship and the second generation’s engineering background are cited as the foundation of its reputation for reliable, custom metalwork.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Steel fabrication", "Stainless steel fabrication", "Custom metal fabrication", "Installation services", "Field measurement", "Custom design", "Delivery", "Stainless steel cable railing fabrication", "Steel stair fabrication", "Handicap railing fabrication", "Miscellaneous metal fabrication"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Residential construction", "Government"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family\u2011owned and operated since 1976", "One\u2011stop shop: design, fabrication, field measurement, delivery, and installation", "Free quotes and on\u2011site measurements", "One\u2011year warranty on all fabricated products", "Multilingual support in English, Spanish, and Italian"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1976 -> db", "Founder Antonio Ciasullo -> /, /about", "Sons Gino (Bentley College, Treasurer/COO) and Emilio (WPI, President/Senior PM) -> /", "Family-owned and operated -> /, /about", "Headquarters Salem, MA -> db, /", "Services: fabrication, installation, field measurement, delivery, free quotes, one-year warranty -> /, /about", "Products: stainless steel railings, stairs, balconies, decks, handicap railings, miscellaneous metal -> /, /about", "Industries: commercial, residential, USPS -> / (capabilities list), /about", "Service area: North Shore communities (Salem, Swampscott, Marblehead, Gloucester, Newburyport, etc.) -> /", "Languages: English, Spanish, Italian -> /about", "Brand: Ultra Tech Cable Hardware -> /about", "Year established 1995 on about page -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "