UPDATE companies SET description='GRT Electronics operates from Raleigh, North Carolina, where it has provided contract electronics manufacturing services for more than four decades.

The shop specializes in full-turnkey electronics manufacturing, running automated SMT lines that place components as small as 0402 and as complex as 1,100-pin BGAs. Services span PCB assembly and rework, electromechanical box-build and rack integration, custom wire and cable harnesses, and a full test suite including burn-in, functional, X-ray, and environmental screening. Typical production runs range from 1 to 1,000 units, with occasional orders reaching 5,000 pieces.

GRT serves the automotive, industrial telecommunications, aerospace and defense, energy, and healthcare sectors. Named customers include Protochips, Robling Medical, Pfizer Zoetis, Analog Devices, ABB, Siemens, Honeywell, Agilent Technologies, Pentair, and Eaton. The company also supports IT server infrastructure and industrial control systems through rack-mounted assembly and high-performance computing integration.

GRT emphasizes a lean, cost-effective approach with on-time, schedule-driven performance and open communication. Its true-turnkey model covers component sourcing, PCB fabrication, assembly, and test under one roof. The quality system is ISO 9001:2015 certified and audited annually by an accredited third party, and the firm offers quick-turn prototypes plus design-for-manufacturing consultation.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB assembly (SMT and through-hole)", "PCB rework (BGA rework, conformal coating, pad/trace repair, solder mask repair)", "Electromechanical assembly (box build, sub-assembly, rack assembly, cable assembly, wire harness, software loading, product configuration, enclosure fabrication)", "Wire and cable harness assembly (custom cable assembly, custom connector configuration, multi-conductor harness)", "Rack-mounted electronics assembly (integrated system assembly for IT, industrial controls, power systems)", "Test and burn-in (electrical/mechanical testing, burn-in test, functional test, X-ray inspection, environmental testing)", "Component X-ray inspection", "Inventory management and partial turnkey services", "Prototype and production design assistance (DFM consultation)", "Engineering consultation (problem solving, cost reduction, process/manufacturing engineering)", "Quick-turn prototype production", "True turnkey service (component sourcing, PCB fabrication, assembly, test)", "Control panel assembly", "Automated SMT placement (0402, 0201, 01005, BGA up to 1100-pin)", "Conformal coating", "Pad/trace repair", "Solder mask repair", "Functional testing", "Burn-in testing", "Environmental testing", "X-ray inspection", "Design for manufacturing (DFM) review", "Predictive maintenance integration", "High-performance computing rack integration"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Industrial telecommunications", "Aerospace and defense", "Energy", "Healthcare"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Automated SMT line