UPDATE companies SET description='Genovac Antibody Discovery operates from its headquarters in Fargo, North Dakota, with additional antibody discovery operations in Freiburg, Germany. The company traces its origins to 1999 when three University of Freiburg professors launched the venture based on the institution’s pioneering antibody research. In 2020, a management-led buyout of Aldevron’s antibody discovery business unit relaunched Genovac under its current structure.

The firm specializes in end-to-end antibody discovery and production against challenging targets such as ion channels and GPCRs. Its platform combines genetic immunization, multiple host species, and several single B cell screening technologies—including the Berkeley Lights Beacon instrument—alongside biologics production and a full suite of characterization services. Genovac reports more than 3,600 completed antibody discovery projects and 25 years of cumulative experience.

Genovac serves biotechnology and pharmaceutical companies developing therapeutic and diagnostic products. Its clients include organizations seeking antibodies against difficult multi-transmembrane proteins, though specific customer names are not disclosed.

The company positions itself as a one-stop-shop “Gene to Antibody” partner, emphasizing a unique combination of immunization technologies, species diversity, and screening platforms that aim to deliver hits where competitors fall short. The 2020 relaunch was driven by a goal to redefine the gold standard for difficult-target antibody delivery through continuous technology improvement.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Antibody discovery", "Antibody production", "Genetic immunization", "Hybridoma technology", "Single B cell screening", "Biologics production", "Antibody characterization", "Therapeutic antibody development", "Diagnostic antibody development", "Gene-to-antibody services"], "industries": ["Biotechnology", "Pharmaceutical", "Therapeutics", "Diagnostics"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Berkeley Lights Beacon instrument"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Genetic immunization technology for challenging targets", "Multiple host species and single B cell screening platforms (including Berkeley Lights Beacon)", "Over 3,600 completed antibody discovery projects", "One-stop-shop from gene to antibody with integrated production and characterization", "25 years of antibody discovery experience"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Fargo, ND -> db, /about", "Operations in Freiburg, Germany -> /about", "Initially launched in 1999 by three University of Freiburg professors -> /about", "Relaunched in 2020 via management-led buyout of Aldevron''s antibody discovery unit -> /about", "Specializes in antibody discovery and production against challenging targets -> db, /about", "Technologies: genetic immunization, multiple host species, multiple single B cell platforms, state-of-the-art production facilities -> db, /about", "Offers biologics production and full suite of characterization services -> /", "Completed over 3,600 antibody discovery projects -> /", "25 years of experience in antibody discovery -> /", "Uses Berkeley Lights Beacon instrument -> /about", "Serves biotech and pharma companies -> /, /about", "One-stop-shop Gene to Antibody partner positioning -> db, /, /about", "Differentiators: unique technology combination, delivering hits where competitors fail -> /, /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Genovac is a contract research and manufacturing organization committed to positioning our clients for the successful development of new transformative drugs and diagnostics.", "founded_year": "1999", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='genovac-antibody-discovery' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='The shop operates as a high-end custom woodworking business serving the San Francisco Bay Area. With over four decades of experience, the business has built a reputation for personal attention to detail and quality.

The company produces custom furniture, kitchen cabinets, and entry doors, and provides finishing, refinishing, antique reproduction, historical restoration, and conservation services. It handles projects from design through construction, finishing, and installation, functioning as a full-service architectural millwork shop. The workshop focuses on custom work rather than mass-produced items.

The shop has worked on historical preservation projects and creates antique reproductions alongside contemporary custom pieces. Its specialties range from magnificent entry doors to kitchen cabinets and custom furniture.

Geoff''s Woodworking distinguishes itself by offering a complete design-to-installation process and by focusing on creative, elegant solutions that go beyond factory-produced furniture and prefabricated cabinets. The company thrives on finding creative, elegant ways to realize client visions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture making", "Cabinet making", "Entry door fabrication", "Finishing", "Refinishing", "Antique reproduction", "Historical restoration", "Conservation", "Design", "Construction", "Installation", "Architectural millwork"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Historical preservation", "Interior design", "Architecture"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full-service design through installation", "Historical restoration and conservation expertise", "Antique reproduction capabilities", "Creative, elegant custom solutions beyond factory furniture"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 -> db", "Headquarters Richmond, California -> db", "Services: custom furniture, cabinets, entry doors, finishing, refinishing, antique reproduction, historical restoration, conservation -> page /", "Full-service design to installation -> page /", "High-end custom finishing, furniture and architectural millwork shop -> page /", "Clients: homeowners, interior designers, architects, contractors -> page /", "Historical preservation projects and antique reproductions -> page /", "Differentiator: creative elegant solutions beyond factory furniture -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are a high-end custom finishing, furniture and architectural millwork shop in Richmond, California.", "founded_year": "1986", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='geoff-s-wood