UPDATE companies SET description='George''s Furniture is a second-generation family-owned business located in Marietta, Pennsylvania, operating from a farm location just outside historic Maytown since 1975. The company was founded in 1970 by George Martin as George''s Woodcrafts, stemming from his early interest in woodworking and a rocking chair design he created at age 10. In 2008, George retired and passed the business to his daughter Juanita and son-in-law Chris Horst, who continue the tradition.

The workshop produces custom handcrafted Amish furniture using 100% solid hardwood—walnut, cherry, oak, and hard maple—with no plywood, particle board, or veneers. Each piece is built by a single craftsman from lumber selection through final finishing, signed and dated for authenticity. The process includes design consultation, customization of dimensions, finish, and details, and handcrafted construction. Typical lead time is 2-3 months. The company sells direct to customers, eliminating middleman markup.

The company serves residential customers seeking heirloom-quality furniture for homes, including tables, chairs, benches, and extension tables. Examples include a customer from Brookeville, MD who purchased a table, chairs, and bench.

The business was started to address frustration with poor-quality furniture; George Martin''s rocking chair innovation reflected a focus on durability and safety. The company differentiates itself through traditional Amish woodworking techniques, a year-long apprenticeship for craftsmen, direct-to-customer sales, and a lifetime value proposition.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture design", "Handcrafted solid wood furniture manufacturing", "Wood selection and grain matching", "Finish application (water-resistant stains)", "Extension table mechanism installation", "Drawer construction with full extension", "Furniture signing and dating"], "industries": ["Custom furniture", "Amish furniture", "Solid wood furniture", "Residential furniture"], "materials": ["Walnut", "Cherry", "Oak", "Hard Maple", "Solid hardwood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "2-3 months", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Each piece signed and dated by its maker", "Direct-to-customer pricing with no middleman markup", "100% solid hardwood; no plywood, particle board, or veneers", "Single craftsman builds each piece from lumber selection to final detail", "Craftsmen complete a year-long apprenticeship in solid wood construction"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1970 -> /about-us", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Location Marietta, PA -> /about-us", "Handcrafted solid hardwood furniture -> /", "Lead time 2-3 months -> /", "Wood types: Walnut, Cherry, Oak, Hard Maple -> /about-us", "Direct-to-customer sales -> /about-us", "Single craftsman per piece -> /about-us", "Signed and dated by maker -> /about-us", "Year-long apprenticeship -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Each piece of furniture is handcrafted right in our workshop then signed by its maker. There is no factory assembly line \u2013 just skilled craftsmen who lovingly follow each piece from the selection of the lumber to the final detail.", "founded