UPDATE companies SET description='Good Source Foods, LLC is headquartered in St Francis, Wisconsin, and was founded in 2019 with a mission to make healthy snacking convenient through ancient grains. The company began by focusing on slow-metabolizing nutrition that avoids the blood sugar spikes common in conventional snacks, building its product line around minimally processed, transparently labeled ingredients.

The company manufactures its own snack products — primarily ancient grain snack bites — in a state-of-the-art facility in the United States that adheres to high food safety and quality standards. While specific facility size, headcount, and production volumes are not disclosed, the operation is designed for clean-label formulation and consistent product integrity.

