UPDATE companies SET description='Growatt USA operates from Santa Ana, California, as the American subsidiary of a global renewable energy company founded in 2011 by David Ding and a group of photovoltaic industry pioneers in Shenzhen, China. The U.S. entity was established in 2013 to support the company''s expanding footprint in the Americas.

The company designs and manufactures a broad portfolio of solar inverters ranging from 0.75 kW to 253 kW, lithium-ion battery storage systems for residential and commercial use, EV chargers (3–22 kW AC and 20/40 kW DC), and cloud-based monitoring hardware and software. Production is centered at an advanced manufacturing plant in Huizhou, China, which began operation in 2021. Globally, the organization employs over 1,000 people and reports more than 6 million end users connected to its cloud platform across 190-plus countries.

Growatt''s solutions target residential, commercial, utility-scale, and transportation sectors. Its customer base includes solar installers, engineering-procurement-construction (EPC) firms, distributors, and end-users. The company works with thousands of local partners to distribute products such as the WIT series commercial inverters, APX high-voltage batteries, and the THOR smart EV charger, and it provides training programs for installers and EPCs.

The founder''s stated vision is to build the world''s largest intelligent sustainable energy ecosystem, with a mission to enable everyone to benefit from sustainable energy. The company emphasizes integrated "solar, storage, and EV charging" solutions managed through a smart energy platform that uses big data, AI, and IoT for generation and consumption prediction.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PV inverter design and manufacturing", "Lithium-ion battery storage system manufacturing", "EV charger design and manufacturing (AC and DC)", "Cloud-based monitoring platform development (ShineDesign)", "Smart energy management software (GroHome)", "Off-grid and microgrid system integration", "Installer/EPC/distributor training programs", "Product warranty and support services", "Solar system design tool (ShineDesign)"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Utility", "Transportation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Global No.1 residential inverter supplier", "Integrated solar, storage, and EV charging solutions", "Smart energy management platform using Big Data, AI, and IoT", "Advanced manufacturing plant in Huizhou", "6 million+ end users connected to cloud platform"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2011 by David Ding -> /about", "US subsidiary established 2013 -> /about", "Headquarters in Santa Ana, California -> db", "Employee count 1000+ -> db", "Products: PV inverters, battery storage, EV chargers, monitoring -> /", "Manufacturing plant in Huizhou (2021) -> /about", "Global footprint: 190+ countries, 6M+ end users -> /", "Industries served: Residential, Commercial, Utility, Transportation -> db", "Integrated solar/storage/EV charging solution -> /about", "Smart energy management with Big Data, AI, IoT -> /", "Training for installers/EPCs/distributors -> /", "Product series: HV MIN, SPH, SPE, SPF, WIT, APX, ALP, THOR, Infinity, NEO -> /about", "Awards: Global No.1 residen