UPDATE companies SET description='Gruenewald Manufacturing Company, Inc. was founded in 1952 in Danvers, Massachusetts. The name Gruenewald, German for "green forest," reflects a long-standing emphasis on environmentally conscious production.

All products are manufactured in the United States, though the company does not disclose facility size, headcount, or annual production volumes.

The company emphasizes that its equipment allows operators to control ingredients and create signature toppings, which it says drives customer loyalty.

